    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RES223 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group practice</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14154 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RES223 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group practice</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14154 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Sessions 53-56</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">All Los</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Four or five students per group. Competency is to be demonstrated by effectively preparing and serving beverage in accordance with the performance criteria and the range listed within the practical learning sessions.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Based on the practical learning sessions of the course.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Bar study room</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Competency in this unit may be assessed through: Demonstration of skills on mixing different (in quantity) international alcoholic beverages in a prescribed timeframe; utilizing systematic liquor pouring and proper bar measurement; mixing of alcoholic concoction showmanship skill techniques.<br>The mark will be given based on each student's performance, not on the whole group's. It means each student will get their own mark.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 14 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 15 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 16 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 17 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 18 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 19 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Session 41 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 42 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 43 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 44 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 45 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 46 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Session 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Session 58 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Session 59 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Session 60 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 14 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 15 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 16 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 17 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 18 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 19 — Quiz 1 &amp; Individual practice 1</li><li>Buổi 41 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 42 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 43 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 44 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 45 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 46 — Quiz 2 &amp; Individual practice 2</li><li>Buổi 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Buổi 58 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Buổi 59 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li><li>Buổi 60 — GROUP PRESENTATION AND REPORT SUBMISSION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
